OL,3,GNEWSANormandy veteran who lied about
OL,4,Aage to enlist dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FA World War Two veteran who fought in
OL,7,Fthe Normandy campaign after lying about
OL,8,Fhis age has died aged 101, a charity
OL,9,Fhas said.
OL,11,FBorn in London in 1925, Donald Turrell
OL,12,Fwas just 17 when he enlisted, having
OL,13,Fforged a letter from his parents to say
OL,14,Fhe was 18.
OL,16,FHis battalion crossed over to France in
OL,17,FJune 1944 in the days following D-Day
OL,18,Fand Turrell landed on Sword Beach
OL,19,Fbefore taking part in fierce fighting.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
