OL,3,GNEWSANormandy veteran who lied about
OL,4,Aage to enlist dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Saturday, the Taxi Charity for
OL,7,FMilitary Veterans said in a post on
OL,8,FFacebook it was "deeply saddened" to
OL,9,Fshare that Turrell, who recently lived
OL,10,Fin Frinton-on-Sea, Essex, had died on
OL,11,FFriday, surrounded by his family.
